  m_text: 'How To Use The Chest:



    Move an Item Into The Chest:

    Click on
    any of your inventory slots that has an item inside it, and that item will be
    automatically moved into the chest.



    Move Item Into Inventory

    Click
    on the chest slot holding that item, and it''ll be automaitcally moved back into
    your inventory.'
